{"id":"fd4a37887a6db2c9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/572_Justification_Logic_JT.md","title":"572 Justification Logic JT","display":"572_Justification_Logic_JT","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{572}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{572}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}\\)</span>。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\">\\(s\\cdot t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(s,t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{just}(t,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{572}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号、替换与相等\">3. 自由符号、替换与相等</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{572}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{572}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{572}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{572}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{572}:\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{572}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{572}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{572},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{572}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{572}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{572})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{572},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{572}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本语言无绑定构造子，因此捕获规避重命名为恒等操作。</p>\n<p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{572}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{572}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,572}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,572}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{572}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{572}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{572}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{572}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{572}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{572}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{572}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{572}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{572}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{572}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{572}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{572}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{572}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{572}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{572}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{572}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{572}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{572},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{572}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{572}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{572}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{572}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列五项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{572}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,572}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,572}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{572}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{572}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{572}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{572}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-JT-证书\">8. JT 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"572\">\\(572\\)</span>-JT 证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t,A)\">\\((t,A)\\)</span>，其目标公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to A\">\\(t:A\\to A\\)</span>，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}\\)</span> 为唯一适型条件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-证据语义载体与后承\">9. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{572}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{572}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{572}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{572}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{572}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{572}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{572}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{572}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{572}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{572}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{572}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{572}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{572}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{572}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{572}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{572}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{572}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ETrue}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{572}A\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ETrue}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{572}A\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\\ (M,w\\models_{572}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{572}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{572}\\ (M,w\\models_{572}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>JT 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{572}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{572}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{572}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{572}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{572}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{572}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{572}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{572}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{572}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的应用与和公理之外加入真实性族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{572}\\)</span>，但证明项语言不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!\">\\(!\\)</span>，且不含正内省、D 或负内省。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{JT}_{572}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{572},\\mathsf{PVar}_{572},\\mathsf{PConst}_{572},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{572},\\mathsf{Frm}_{572},\\operatorname{PV}_{572},\\operatorname{TV}_{572},\\operatorname{TVF}_{572},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{572},\\operatorname{freshP}_{572},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572},\\operatorname{SubT}_{572},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572},\\equiv_{\\alpha,572},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{572},\\mathsf{Ax}_{572},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572},\\mathsf{Proof}_{572},\\vdash_{572},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572},\\models_{572},\\models_{572}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{JT}_{572}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{572},\\mathsf{PVar}_{572},\\mathsf{PConst}_{572},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{572},\\mathsf{Frm}_{572},\\operatorname{PV}_{572},\\operatorname{TV}_{572},\\operatorname{TVF}_{572},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{572},\\operatorname{freshP}_{572},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{572},\\operatorname{SubT}_{572},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{572},\\equiv_{\\alpha,572},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{572},\\mathsf{Ax}_{572},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{572},\\mathsf{Proof}_{572},\\vdash_{572},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{572},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{572},\\models_{572},\\models_{572}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 JT 的显式证明项句法、公理、证明对象、可证性、证据模型和语义后承；不含模态对应定理或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号、替换与相等","text":"3. 自由符号、替换与相等","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-JT-证书","text":"8. JT 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-证据语义载体与后承","text":"9. 证据语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{572}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{572}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}","display":false},{"tex":"s+t","display":false},{"tex":"s\\cdot t","display":false},{"tex":"t:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{just}(t,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{572}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{572}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operato